+    // BlitzRecomp (PSP, docs/PSP_PORT.md §4.3): a ROM that isn't held whole in memory, read through a provider.
+    // With none set (the default) the ROM is the in-memory copy or mapping, as before. With one set, do_rom_read and
+    // do_rom_pio read through it, the stored ROM file isn't read or hashed at start (the platform has checked it),
